 game, an illusion woven from failure and hypocrisy. Unsurprisingly, he's not the most popular guy. Meanwhile, there's Yukino Yukinoshita - brilliant, beautiful, and chillier than winter in Antarctica. Would you believe she's not exactly beloved by her classmates either? The unlikely pair gets forced into a club dedicated to helping solve their fellow students' problems. But will an ice queen and a screw-up really be able to help anybody?","year":2012,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"118","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/23b51846-bec4-41e4-a9a2-a034064d01eb/57be50e8-6ca7-4cc8-b09b-a869c550a80e.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["id","vi","es-la","ru","it","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.38,"follows":3869,"listAt":"2026-10-25T00:58:11.811Z","chapters":[{"id":"762e2270-e0a1-4fcf-81ce-88fc469942ea","number":"118","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-10-19T02:27:05+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a6c1dd7f-376b-4bce-a21c-6413cd36015a","number":"117","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T15:34:09+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3fff1901-e479-4732-aad6-343e09b08c19","number":"116","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T13:35:47+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"74ca696b-33ce-4461-b036-562fca454be9","number":"115","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T10:48:34+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d960bdd5-f6ae-4632-b868-156979cce4a6","number":"114","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T08:18:57+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"24faa4de-dd81-44ca-ac78-467449b6e67b","number":"113","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T19:07:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"072c16c7-c1c9-4828-be00-dd8882ddc9a0","number":"112","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":28,"cre